The '''Carpenter''' is an [[NPC]] located within the {{Zone|Foraging Camp}}, as well as the [[Garden]].

== Quests ==
The '''Carpentry''' asks the player to gather {{Item|Wool|amount=64}} for them to unlock to the {{Skill|Carpentry}} skill.

Later, they appear in the [[Garden]] to help the player unlock the [[Greenhouse]] with the {{Item|Greenhouse Blueprint}}. Once unlocked, the '''Carpenter''' will appear there and allow players to view their unlocked [[Mutations]] and unlock more plots in the Greenhouse using {{Item|Ethereal Vine}}s.

